Earshot Audio is an independent FrameCore Works wrapper for Earshot 0.4.0
by Leon Lin, https://github.com/Leonxlnx/earshot, MIT.

The wrapper includes FrameCore Works instructions, a launcher, a local source
record adapter, dependency locks and provenance metadata. Upstream engine code
and real-sound resources are downloaded separately at the pinned commit during
authorized setup. They retain their original notices and MIT license.

Model weights, third-party dependencies and user recordings retain their own
licenses. This package's license does not relicense those materials. Creative
Studio and sibling plugins are optional callers, not runtime dependencies.
